  "variables": {},
  "styles": [],
  "selector": ".therapist-section",
  "description": "A homepage section about your care: Your Therapist, a line of copy, then one card. Find a therapist invites you to choose one, Session booked shows the next session, Book next session asks for a time, and Join session is for when it is time to start.",
